To the extent any part of this directory is in fact separable from the GPL works
named above and solely ours, that part is ALSO offered under the terms of
UNLICENSE.txt, at your option.


ON BINARIES

A binary built with SS_ENABLE_DOOM=ON is a combined work with doomgeneric and
Chocolate Doom, and can only be redistributed under GPL-2.0 regardless of what
this file says about the source. A default build contains none of it.

This states the terms offered. It is not legal advice.
